  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali - Youth-Led Local Service Accountability Labs to improve local governance and accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This pilot project supports a Malian CSO to establish and run a series of Youth-Led Local Service Accountability Labs to monitor service delivery in education, health, and water and sanitation using social accountability tools. Young people will work with local and national authorities to identify service gaps and deficiencies and recommend solutions. Robust MEL throughout will assess the approach&#x2019;s scalability regionally and nationally.</narrative>
  </description>
